{"id":"taki","lemma":"таки","pos":"other","rank":2014,"glosses":["still, after all, in spite of (everything)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/76/LL-Q7737_%28rus%29-Cinemantique-%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%B8.wav","examples":[{"text":"Всё-таки она не пришла.","en":"She didn't come after all.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/655479","words":[{"g":"everything, all"},null,{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to come , to arrive","l":"прийти"}]},{"text":"Значит, ты всё-таки мужчина.","en":"So you're a man after all.","words":[{"g":"so"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"everything, all"},null,{"g":"man"}]},{"text":"Я всё-таки хочу это видеть.","en":"All the same, I want to see it.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"everything, all"},null,{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to see"}]},{"text":"Это всё-таки лучше, чем ничего.","en":"It's still better than nothing.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"everything, all"},null,{"g":"rather, would better )"},{"g":"than"},{"g":"nothing"}]},{"text":"Я всё-таки решил этого не делать.","en":"I've decided not to do that after all.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1267742","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"everything, all"},null,{"g":"to solve, to settle","l":"решить"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to make, to do"}]}]}